# Runtime state and credentials: the SQLite DB and its WAL/SHM sidecars, the API tokens, the hook
# caches, and the pending-proposal queue. The directory is ignored wholesale and recreated on
# start (store.js mkdirs it) — the previous per-filename allowlist went stale the moment a new
# token file was added, leaving a live token untracked but unignored.
data/
